'''Blue Candy''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that was awarded to the Top 100 players on the [[Christmas Event 2017]] Leaderboard.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       

==Appearance==
The Blue Candy has the same appearance as [[Candy]], but the red color is replaced with a cyan coloring.

==Trivia==
*During the event, players would collect [[Snow Tokens|Winter Tokens]] (acting exactly like [[coins]] but Christmas-exclusive) and points, which determined their rank on the leaderboard.
*This knife partners with [[Blue Sugar]], making the Blue Candy Set owned by very few.
*Other variants of this include [[Bronze Candy]], [[Silver Candy]], and [[Gold Candy]].
**The trophy reskins were awarded 2 years after the original [[Candy]] was added to the game.
*This item is a blue reskin of [[Candy]], a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife.
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*It is the only trophy that does not update the owner's name when changed. Instead, it continues to display whatever username the owner had at the time of receiving the trophy.
*Here is the [https://youtu.be/5TdDAutoGwA?si=Lo9uXqULf6-ANfL1 video] list of every owner of this weapon
